# PCF: authorize multiple DNAIs per session (Npcf_PolicyAuthorization)
#
# Upstream : https://gitlab.eurecom.fr/oai/cn5g/oai-cn5g-pcf.git
# Base     : 67aee53df01542a0deccf32874bfb90b38c547b3
# Apply    : git checkout 67aee53df01542a0deccf32874bfb90b38c547b3 && git apply <this file>
#
# Lets an AF routing requirement install a TrafficControlData listing more than
# one DNAI, so analytics have a set to select WITHIN. The PCF remains the
# authorization authority; it does not choose.
#
